🚀 Best Practices in React

Use useContext for Singleton-like state (instead of Redux for simple cases).
Prefer Custom Hooks over HOCs for reusability (Decorator pattern).
Use React.lazy and Suspense for lazy loading (Proxy pattern).
Leverage useReducer for complex state logic (Command pattern).
Create API service wrappers (Facade pattern) for cleaner code.


